{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/622748-weaver-back-up","id":622748,"title":"Weaver back up?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-10T15:57:42-07:00","id":622748,"title":"Weaver back up?","content":"If you're characters are planning to raid a Hellhole, is it advisable to ask the help of the Weaver's forces? The Weaver doesn't like the Garou and vise versa but would they both cooperate in trying to kill all of the city's smog spirits or wiping out the Banes living in a building used for human trafficking?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-16T07:47:33-07:00","id":628629,"title":"","content":"This is one of those things that's stupidly conditional. You cannot really talk to Weaver's agents, and you cannot really expect them to think in the same way you do. However, actually manipulating them or manouverign them into the conflict with the agents of the Wyrm is possible, even if it is a double-edged sword.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-17T08:48:10-07:00","id":629972,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/622748-weaver-back-up#post622748\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you're characters are planning to raid a Hellhole, is it advisable to ask the help of the Weaver's forces? The Weaver doesn't like the Garou and vise versa but would they both cooperate in trying to kill all of the city's smog spirits or wiping out the Banes living in a building used for human trafficking?</div> </div> </div> </div>Friend Computer will happily assimilate that Node into his network. Thank you, Friend Citizen for reporting its vulnerabilities to Friend Computer. Please report for re-education so Friend Computer can ensure further compliance.<br /> <br /> HAVE A NICE DAY","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-17T13:26:14-07:00","id":630215,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/622748-weaver-back-up#post622748\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you're characters are planning to raid a Hellhole, is it advisable to ask the help of the Weaver's forces? The Weaver doesn't like the Garou and vise versa but would they both cooperate in trying to kill all of the city's smog spirits or wiping out the Banes living in a building used for human trafficking?</div> </div> </div> </div>First off, I am skeptical of how you would even contact 'the Weaver.' Just walk up to the nearest pattern/net spider and ask it nicely? That doesn't sound like a recipe for success, the things aren't rational. Even if the Weaver-aligned spirits act on the information given them, there is no guarantee the crazy spirits are going to 'cooperate' in a way the Garou would want. They might just calcify everyone- or ignore the Wyrm spirits entirely and attempt to destroy the Garou.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}